flowchart LR
  P[push / PR] --> L[lint: ruff + eslint + tsc]
  L --> T[test: pytest + coverage >= 70%]
  T --> EV["eval: Recall@10 >= 0.70, Hit@10 >= 0.95"]
  EV --> B[docker buildx multi-stage]
  B --> S[trivy scan + push GHCR]
  S --> D[deploy staging -> smoke -> prod]
  D --> K["k6 smoke: fail nếu p95 >= 1500ms"]
  K --> R[publish report.html + badge]
